  "all_ingredients_flat": "chickpea flour, homemade soy yogurt, water, lemon juice, green chillies, garlic, turmeric powder, salt, dry roasted mustard seeds, sesame seeds, finely chopped cilantro",
  "instructions": "+ BATTER: Blend everything together. Ensure there are no lumps. Pressure cook in an Instant Pot for 12 mins. After 12 mins, immediately release the pressure.\n+ Give the cooked batter a quick stir/whisk and spread it on silicone mats. Silicone mats helps us spread the dough smoothly without oil or grease. Cut into pieces and gently make rolls.\n+ Spread some dry roasted mustard seeds & sesame seeds all over the Khandvi rolls. Garnish with finely chopped cilantro. Serve & enjoy!",
  "cooking_methods": [
